OL,3,AHow Dolly Parton told her life story
OL,4,Athrough six iconic songs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe much-loved US singer-songwriter,
OL,7,Factress and philanthropist Dolly
OL,8,FParton, who has died aged 80, was known
OL,9,Fas the Queen of Country.
OL,11,FRaised in Tennessee, she rose to fame
OL,12,Fin the late 1960s with hits that
OL,13,Fbridged country and pop music.
OL,15,FHer songs covered deeply personal
OL,16,Fthemes around growing up poor, love and
OL,17,Floss, as well as female empowerment and
OL,18,Fspirituality.
OL,20,FLive updates: Dolly Parton, legendary
OL,21,FUS country singer, dies aged 80
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
